<!--
  A correctly-encoded feed in an Apple category whose name contains an
  ampersand. XML requires that & be written as &amp; in content, so this is
  what a healthy feed in one of the five ampersand categories looks like on
  the wire. It must not be reported as an invalid category.

  The bare & in the line above is deliberate and legal: inside a comment it
  needs no escaping, the document parses, and the unescaped-entity check must
  not flag it.
-->
